extends ../layout

block content
  section.band.page.page-narrow
    h1 Your recovery codes
    p.lede Two step sign in is on. Save these codes somewhere safe now. Each one works once, and they are the way back in if you lose your authenticator app.

    ul.codes
      each code in codes
        li
          code.secret= code

    p.note This is the only time these are shown. They are stored hashed, so they cannot be shown again.
    .button-row
      a.button(href="/account") Back to your account
